; The parameter mechanism: every slot is `lerp(min, max, random) * curve(age)`.
; Here `scale_amount` grows then collapses and `angle` sweeps, both driven by a
; `Curve` sub-resource, so a steady-state emitter shows the whole curve at once
; — one particle per age.

